 Ede was home to 116,000 people.","grounding":[{"source":"wikivoyage","title":"Ede","url":"https://en.wikivoyage.org/wiki/Ede","licence":"CC BY-SA 4.0"}],"short":"Ede is a city in the Netherlands that works better as a base than a destination, with the woods and heath of the Veluwe starting at its edge. Planken Wambuis, the Grebbeberg and the Posbank are the reasons to head out; ten hours, May through August.","short_src":"rewrite","facts":{"population":67670,"visit_h":7.3}},"highlights":[{"id":"hl-grebbeberg","name":"Grebbeberg","kind":"Monument","lat":51.95177,"lon":5.60089,"dist_km":9.9,"rank_score":6.7,"resolved_by":"catalogue"}],"do":[{"name":"Henschotermeer","type":"swim","detail":"20 km away, water rated Excellent","ref":{"layer":"lakes","cc":"NL","id":"nl-henschotermeer-Q580977"},"sources":["eea","layer"],"evidence":{"method":"open","n_sources":2,"sources":["eea","layer"]}}],"nearby":{"beaches":[{"layer":"beaches","cc":"NL","id":"nl-henschotermeer-way75763183","name":"Henschotermeer","km":20.2,"bearing":"W","lat":52.08029,"lon":5.37368,"tier":1,"score":7.0,"thumb":"https://upload.wikimedia.org/wikipedia/commons/thumb/f/f6/Henschotermeer1.jpg/500px-Henschotermeer1.jpg","water":"Excellent","thumb_ok_print":true},{"layer":"beaches","cc":"NL","id":"nl-spiegelwaal-way614479970","name":"Spiegelwaal","km":24.2,"bearing":"SE","lat":51.85509,"lon":5.85981,"tier":1,"score":6.8,"thumb":"https://upload.wikimedia.org/wikipedia/commons/thumb/d/da/De_LentloperSpiegelwaal_Veur_Lent_Nevengeul_3.jpg/500px-De_LentloperSpiegelwaal_Veur_Lent_Nevengeul_3.jpg","water":"Excellent","thumb_ok_print":true},{"layer":"beaches","cc":"NL","id":"nl-veur-lent-way59193272","name":"Veur Lent","km":24.6,"bearing":"SE","lat":51.85289,"lon":5.86695,"tier":1,"score":6.7,"thumb":"https://upload.wikimedia.org/wikipedia/commons/thumb/5/5f/De_Lentloper.jpg/500px-De_Lentloper.jpg","water":"Excellent","thumb_ok_print":true},{"layer":"beaches","cc":"NL","id":"nl-klingelbeek-way1171801678","name":"Klinge